#: a4702a94ab964249980eb310bef44eaa
msgid ""
"RPM/DEB installation scripts (e.g. looking at constraints who would hijack "
"other packages),"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/general/package-contributions.rst:86
#: c7a73adf8ec6481dbaa9c396b3580d8f
msgid "Makefiles,"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/general/package-contributions.rst:88
#: 5f4acdf813e74cafbd507bdc8b80256e
msgid "Package build `reproducible <https://reproducible-builds.org/>`__"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/general/package-contributions.rst:92
#: 23c630bfaa814c2697fc679ae0eb1a3d
msgid ""
"and any steps which would result in partial/total compromise of legitimate "
"components. For this part, you can have a look to an example package called "
"`qubes-skeleton <https://github.com/QubesOS-contrib/qubes-skeleton>`__."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/general/package-contributions.rst:95
#: 2a53a3909cf44b6e83ef872f8c5c2567
msgid "Package Maintainers"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/general/package-contributions.rst:98
#: e9709c5145a04992b72d4f09733b0d39
msgid ""
"If you contribute a package, we assume that you will be the maintainer of "
"that package, unless you tell us otherwise. As the maintainer of the "
"package, it is your privilege and responsibility to:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/general/package-contributions.rst:100
#: cd0a31ad5f1e4e62814a08c4817c2740
msgid ""
":ref:`Review <developer/general/package-contributions:review procedure>` "
"each pull request made against the package."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/general/package-contributions.rst:102
#: b8db7aa6e2964fcaa2d6745bda4f0f8c
msgid ""
"Decide when the package has reached a new version, and notify the Qubes core "
"developers when this occurs."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/general/package-contributions.rst:106
#: 91d1973222cb4569a0b8798103a8a2a9
msgid ""
"If you do not wish to be the maintainer of your package, please let us know. "
"If you do not act on your maintainer duties for a given package for an "
"extended period of time and after at least one reminder, we will assume that "
"you no longer wish to be the maintainer for that package."
msgstr ""
